Moves the camera at once for a flight whose duration is too long, instead
of animating it or throwing. AnimationOptions gains maxDuration, as GL JS's
flyTo() has: a flight longer than it, by a set or a derived duration, jumps.
A derived duration that Native's duration type can't hold jumps too, instead
of throwing.
Upstream: not proposed

